_draw_counter() draws the wooden counter, its top, trim and panels using rectangles and lines.
_draw_actor() draws the shopkeeper or player from layered shapes, including bodies, faces, hair, clothing and eyes.
_draw_object_art() draws the bucket, potions, herbs, scroll and gold.
For the bucket, for example, the code literally tells Pygame where to place the points of a tapered polygon, how thick its rim should look, and where to add highlights. Put the pieces together, and your eye recognizes a bucket.
